WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.767
This query keeps each completed admission It
calculates stay days

00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:11.672
for the admission and also calculates the patient's
average stay using a window The

00:00:11.686 --> 00:00:17.401
average is repeated beside each admission for that
patient This is useful

00:00:17.427 --> 00:00:21.335
when you need to compare an individual stay with the
patient's usual pattern
